5. Added basic mock for i18n to prevent errors
6. Maintained the existing functionality with params and searchParams

The providers are now added in the same order as they appear in the stack trace, which should resolve the module loading issue. The Suspense wrapper will handle any loading states during the dynamic import.

Note that some of these providers might need additional configuration depending on your specific use case, but this basic setup should resolve the immediate error. If you encounter any specific provider-related errors, we can further customize their configuration as needed.

